## API skill files

Per-API agent references (one markdown file each):

- [Abstract](https://orthogonal.com/discover/abstractapi/skill.md): Verify every user and stop fraud before it starts. Verify emails, phone numbers and IPs, block fraud and bots, and enrich your data with Abstract.
- [AgentMail](https://orthogonal.com/discover/agentmail/skill.md): Programmatic email for AI agents. Create inboxes, send/receive emails, manage threads and drafts. Inboxes cost $2/month. Inboxes inactive for 30+ days are automatically deleted.
- [AgentPhone](https://orthogonal.com/discover/agentphone/skill.md): Give your AI agent a real phone number. Make calls, send and receive messages across iMessage, WhatsApp, SMS and more to have conversations in the real world — all via API.
